tone: trouble
life: work, community
horizon: months
roles: colleague
earth: the council offers your community centre a year's grant if every group pays for its room, and the pensioners' tea and the youth night have always met for free
times: Most community centre managers, once or twice in their years in the post; council grants often come with conditions on charging (estimate)
